# The demo floppy's sessions (DESIGN D25 revision 3, 7.3; man dlogin). At the first start of a boot dlogin starts
# the Desktop session for guest by itself (autologin); after Log out the login screen shows as usual (guest has no
# password here).
session Desktop = /bin/sh /usr/lib/demo/session
session Text console = text
autologin guest Desktop
